    "catalog:note": "Pedestal wash basin against the wall. rim 0.85. The rim plate has a round through-hole with a liner and floor below it; the pedestal stands under the bowl's back half. The tap stem and spout are thin round parts. Parts under radius 0.04 build as polygonal prisms at true size.",
